{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "c6997160-c2d9-886d-81bf-4654a0631522",
  "created_at": "2026-02-23T11:37:16-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Priya Mensah",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:33:26-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:33:29-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, hi. Sorry, one sec, I'm like, tying my kid's shoe with the phone on my shoulder? Okay. Hi. I'm calling about the storm drain in front of my house. It's 236 Harrison Avenue, the Fort Adams side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:33:48-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, take your time. 236 Harrison. What's going on with the drain?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:33:55-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So with last weekend's nor'easter, Saturday into Sunday, the drain totally backed up, and the water came up the driveway and got right to the basement door. Like, right up to the bottom of the door? But it did not get in. We were lucky."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:34:16-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so the water reached the door but your basement stayed dry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:34:22-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, exactly. Dry. But it was really close, and I just want it logged that it happened, you know? In case it gets worse next time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:34:35-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely, I'll log it. Was the drain clogged with leaves and debris, or could you see?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:34:43-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It looked like it was packed with leaves and, like, sand and stuff. Water was just sitting on top of it and not going down. Can you send someone to clean it out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:34:59-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I'll put in a request for the drain to be cleaned. Crews are pretty busy after a storm like that, but it goes in the queue. [pause] Sorry, let me get this typed. Is it right in front of the house or at the corner?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:35:21-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right in front. Like, at the curb by our driveway. Hold on, other shoe. [pause] Okay, sorry. Yeah, in front."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:35:31-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Anything else the crew should know about getting in there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:35:37-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, yeah, there's an older neighbor next door who can't really get out? Like, she doesn't walk well. So if the street floods she's kind of stuck. That's part of why I'm calling."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:35:53-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's good to know, I'll note it on the request so they see it's a concern for the street access. Do you know which house is hers?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:36:06-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's the one to the left of us if you're facing the house. I don't want to give her name, she'd be embarrassed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:36:17-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, the note will just say an elderly neighbor, left side. And what's a good number in case someone needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:36:29-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, it's 401-555-0181."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:36:31-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0181. Perfect. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:36:34-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Priya Mensah. M-E-N-S-A-H."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:36:36-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Priya. So I have the drain at 236 Harrison Avenue, backed up in the nor'easter, water to the basement door but no water inside, cleaning requested, and a neighbor who has trouble getting out. Did I miss anything?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:36:54-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's everything. That's perfect."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:36:57-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Someone should be out within the next week or so, and if it rains hard before then, call us back and we'll bump it up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:37:10-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, thank you so much. Bye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:37:14-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bye now."
    }
  ],
